LanguageData.CaravansCriticallyEnhanced_AlertNoPermit:
A forming caravan is waiting where it gathered, because no map edge it can reach is inside the allowed area of every pawn going with it. Kept in by:

{0}

To let it go, extend their areas to a map edge the caravan can reach, remove their restriction, or use "Force caravan departure". Turning off "Leave inside allowed areas" in the mod's options also lets it go.
